  "description": "Baek Eunsu is a perfectionist R&D team leader raised in a family of educators. Han Yui is a new employee from a wealthy family, the kind of accomplished daughter every parent dreams of, yet she is more honest and outspoken than anyone else. Their peaceful office lives are suddenly shattered when Eunsu develops the ability of psychometry. He is a man who has no desire to uncover other people’s secrets, while she is a woman desperate to keep her true feelings hidden. What follows is a dizzying workplace relationship that feels almost like living together. Amid the constant bickering between the germaphobic team leader and the accident-prone rookie, an unexpected romance begins to blossom. But will they survive after confronting the truths they most desperately want to hide from each other?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/840079766)",
